00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:33.060
But I would argue, that it's just the opposite,
Skypea might actually turn out to be one of

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:49.530
the most important arcs in the entire story,
and Enel one of the most interesting characters.

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:55.350
Personality wise, I think you agree that Enel
