00:02:55.350 --> 00:03:02.190
inhabited by three races of sky people is
full of conflict. We have the tribal Shandians,

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:07.760
who were at war with the angel-like skypeans,
only for Enel to come in and make enemies

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:13.560
out of both. He conquers the land and declares
himself God, ruling from the comfort of his

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:20.200
residence, where surrounded by pretty women,
with his heavenly mantra he controls and punishes

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:24.970
anyone who speaks badly of him.

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:34.940
The 
god theme is actually pretty strong with Enel.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:41.460
First of all his name: Enel is most likely
based on the deity Enlil and El, from which

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:48.590
many names honoring the biblical go are descended.
Micheal, Rapahael, Esekiel, you get the idea.

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:54.630
Funnily enough Enel is also the name of Italy's
largest electricity provider. His thunder

00:03:54.630 --> 00:04:00.180
powers of course a reminiscent of deities
like Zeus, while the metal ring with Tomoe

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:05.170
drums set into his back are clearly inspired
by the Japanese thunder deity Raijin. By the

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:18.730
way, that must be the most uncomfortable piercing
anyone ever had. In other words, Oda made

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:23.830
it a point to mash as many different gods
into this character as possible. The cherry

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:29.830
on top is the fact that Enel's big goal is
leaving earth and reaching the fairy verth,

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:39.270
or as I like to call it: Moon. For Enel, the
moon is the natural realm of god, so clearly

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:48.499
he must get there. After all, he believes
himself to be a god. -

00:04:48.499 --> 00:04:56.800
A&nbsp;god complex&nbsp;is an unshakable belief in
one's own importance, characterized by consistently

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:07.060
inflated feelings of personal&nbsp;ability,&nbsp;privilege,
or&nbsp;infallibility. A person with a god complex

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:12.419
may refuse to admit the possibility of their
error or failure, even in the face of irrefutable

00:05:12.419 --> 00:05:26.819
evidence, intractable problems or difficult
or impossible tasks. The person is also highly

00:05:26.819 --> 00:05:31.720
dogmatic in their views, meaning the person
speaks of their personal opinions as though

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:44.789
they were unquestionably correct.&nbsp;Someone
with a god complex may exhibit no regard for

00:05:44.789 --> 00:05:50.870
the&nbsp;conventions and demands of society, and
may request special consideration or privileges,

00:05:50.870 --> 00:06:06.289
basically making it a severe form of narcism.
I'm sure some of you just felt like I described

00:06:06.289 --> 00:06:10.900
someone you know. Make sure they don't get
their hands on a devil fruit!

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:16.789
Now, understandably, all this may sound twisted
and delusional to you, ..because it is, but

00:06:16.789 --> 00:06:21.839
Enel has the power to back it up, wielding
the powerful Goro Goro no mi, which allows

00:06:21.839 --> 00:06:27.199
him to control, transform into and create
electricity at will. Next to Blackbeard's

00:06:27.199 --> 00:06:33.000
Yami Yami no mi and Whitebeards Gura Gura
no mi, it's named as one of the most powerful

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:47.819
and destructive devil fruits in the OP universe.
So powerful in fact, that he can easily annihilate

00:06:47.819 --> 00:06:55.699
an entire island, something that the ancient
weapon Pluton is infamous for. A one man buster

00:06:55.699 --> 00:07:02.059
call if you will. Oda even stated that at
the time, Enel would have gained a bounty

00:07:02.059 --> 00:07:08.599
of at least 500 million berries if he were
a pirate down on earth, simply for his power

00:07:08.599 --> 00:07:09.599
alone.

00:07:09.599 --> 00:07:15.580
But Enel was not only strong and evil, terrifying
a whole land, he's also charismatically smart

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:29.889
and has a decent sense 
of humor. - Enel come across as pretty stupid

00:07:29.889 --> 00:07:35.210
in some ways, and in some ways he is, but
he is also the guy who restarted his own heart

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:41.479
and build a damn spaceship powered by himself
to reach the moon. And here people say that

00:07:41.479 --> 00:07:51.710
Luffy is creative with his devil fruit. Enel
is not a villain, he's an experience. -

00:07:51.710 --> 00:08:00.169
What sets Enel apart from other antagonists
in the story is his arc wit Luffy, which is

00:08:00.169 --> 00:08:05.070
also why I strongly believe that we will see
him again in the story. Here's the deal: For

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:10.249
most major villains in the story, just like
for Enel, we get a decent amount of set-up

00:08:10.249 --> 00:08:15.409
for just how bad and evil they are. And indeed
we do get the impression of how tyrannical

00:08:15.409 --> 00:08:21.619
and frightening his rule over Skypea truly
is. Plus, Enel and his men are messing most

00:08:21.619 --> 00:08:25.830
of the straw hats up worse than in almost
any other arc until that point. - 5 left - The

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:32.029
fact that Enel himself came for many of the
straw hats unlike even crocodile, was a first,

00:08:32.029 --> 00:08:43.260
that made it clear how much of a threat he
was. And yet, Enel's encounter with Luffy

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:49.770
lack the elements all other major villains
in one piece share. First of all, we get no

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:54.570
backstory or motivation for his actions. All
we know is that he destroyed the island of

00:08:54.570 --> 00:09:00.441
his people, Birka, and took an army with him
to subdue skypea. What's up with that? We

00:09:00.441 --> 00:09:05.700
don't know why he ended up destroying an entire
island, why he doesn't have wings, where he

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:13.410
got his fruit or why he wants to go to the
moon so desperately. Enel is the type of character

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:19.570
that seems to have a very fascinating and
relevant backstory, and we never get to hear

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:24.710
it. The second thing, is that Luffy's actions
always punish the villain in some way or form

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:32.090
for their deeds and end their desire. Crocodile
and Doflamingo end up in prison, Lucci has

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:42.010
to let Robin escape, Ceasar looses his lab,
Big mom looses the vinsmoke technology, ... you

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:46.560
get the idea. Enel however, while robbed of
the golden bell, simply proceeds with his

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:52.750
plans to go to the moon as if nothing happened.
Luffy protects skypea and fulfills his promise

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:59.900
to ring the bell, but he doesn't change Enel
or stop his initial goal. These two things

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:05.060
suggest to me that Enel might return at some
point.

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:13.460
But of course there is a lot more to that.
Now let'a get into worldbuidling. Oh, boy

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:17.890
where to start. First of all, as you know,
Enel is the first enemy that uses openly uses

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:23.810
observation Haki against Luffy, also pretty
damn potent observation Haki at that, being

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:36.880
aware of the entire island. Since we haven't
met Whiteboard yet, this is also the first

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:43.160
devil fruit power we meet, that in terms of
destructiveness blows everything out of proportion.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:58.240
Smoker and Crocodile look pretty ridiculous
compared to this -

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:03.740
The most important thing about skypea, however,
is what it tells us about the history of the

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:08.730
world. Skypea tells us not only about the
existence of islands in the sky, an entire

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:15.370
world above the clouds, it teaches a lot about
the past. As it turns out Shandora, the ancient

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:21.950
city of one of the sky races, was affiliated
with the ancient kingdom. Not only do we find

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:29.450
a poneglyph there pointing to fisherman island,
but we also find a legendary city of gold,

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:34.670
that already trumps anything the one piece
could offer in terms of gold and silver. Additionally,

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:41.520
we are also introduced to Noland, a Roger-like
character, that seems to play a very important

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:52.110
role in the story as well.

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:58.910
But as if this wasn't enough already, we also
find out in probably the most important cover

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:04.220
story we ever got, that this race of sky people,
did not only have an ancient civilization

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:14.980
down on earth, all 3 of the races actually
come from the very same moon Enel went to.

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:20.750
And here things get crazy. We learn that the
sky people had this ridiculously advanced

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:25.470
country there on the moon, creating sentient
machines, before flying down to earth after

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:31.490
using up all the resources there. We also
see some of the robots being build on Karakuri

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:36.880
island, accidentally the same highly technological
place, that Dr. Vegapunk is from and where

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:49.480
Franky spent the time skip. Oh yeah, and there
are space pirates as well, and their Logo

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:59.600
looks like Fukurokujo from Wano, who has the
same earlobes as Enel and ... huhhh. You see,

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:05.070
I'm pretty sure skypea will be one of the
most important arcs in retrospect, one we

00:13:05.070 --> 00:13:11.480
enter the endgame.I actually have a fantastic
theory in store for you guys about the ancient

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:15.970
kingdom and skypea. If you're interested let
me know in the comments.

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:21.810
And going back to Enel, who now has this entire
army of robots on the moon, one more important

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:32.060
thing is the name of his home, that he destroyed:
Birka. You see Birka is not only the name

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:38.200
of the ancient moon city, but also a real
historical place. The real-life Birka was

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:44.040
one of the most important trade centers in
Scandinavia during the Viking Age. And what

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:50.760
island is viking-themed? Yes. You! Exactly,
Elbaf! Ten points to Huffelpuff. And we know

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:55.160
that Elbaf has both this giant tree growing
into the sky, and we also know that there

00:13:55.160 --> 00:14:03.250
is a proper entrance to the sky islands somewhere
in the new world. Coincidence? - All of this

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:09.090
implies to me, that one of the most interesting
characters with an unfinished character arc,

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:15.080
should come back at some point in the future.
And even if he doesn't, Enel wasn't just a

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:20.600
villain, he was an experience. -

